{"id":"maglietta","lemma":"maglietta","pos":"noun","rank":1816,"glosses":["T-shirt / tee-shirt","vest, undershirt","ring, eye, loop (as in a ship's rigging)"],"ipa":"/maʎˈʎet.ta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"magliette"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-maglietta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Vuoi questa maglietta?","en":"Do you want this shirt?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1010051","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"volere"},{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null]},{"text":"Ama il colore della sua maglietta.","en":"She loves the color of her T-shirt.","words":[{"g":"to love, to like","l":"amare"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"color/colour"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"his, hers, its","l":"suo"},null]},{"text":"Puoi stirarmi questa maglietta, per favore?","en":"Can you iron this T-shirt for me, please?","words":[{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"},null,{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"please"]]},{"text":"Mi sono tolto la maglietta.","en":"I took off my shirt.","words":[{"g":"me / myself"},{"g":"am / are","l":"essere"},{"g":"to take off, take away","l":"togliere"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La nostra squadra portava delle magliette rosse.","en":"Our team were wearing red shirts.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"our","l":"nostro"},{"g":"set square, triangle"},{"g":"to bring","l":"portare"},null,null,{"g":"red","l":"rosso"}]}]}